window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The ghosts of our past have come back to haunt us.</b><br> <br> Kidnapped and sold to the highest bidder, I’m promised to marry another man, a ruthless Mafia boss who has an ax to grind with the Salvatore brothers.<br> <br> And he wants to use me to get his revenge.<br> <br> The men we thought were hunting me are the least of our problems. As it turns out, the real monsters were right under our noses all along.<br> <br> I have faith my savage knights will find me.<br> I know they will burn down the world for their queen.<br> <br> But our enemies will stop at nothing to destroy our happily ever after.</p>"; 
